@title EMC fix-it: before/after banner in the 3D EMC view, Light theme
@area 3D
@sizes 1366x768 1920x1080
# Same as 410 in the Light theme: the banner and the overlays follow the theme palette. The pictures are the evidence.
open qa/fixtures/emc-cabinet-bonding.novo
wait 20
key ctrl+k
wait 6
text preferences
wait 8
key Enter
wait 10
click_text Light
wait 10
key Escape
wait 20
key ctrl+k
wait 6
text emc check
wait 8
key Enter
wait 30
scroll 360 400 -300
wait 10
click_text "Preview: Scrape the mounting area bare" #1
wait 10
click_text "In 3D"
wait 40
expect "Previewing a fix"
shot 01-after-light
check_layout
click_text Before #1
wait 20
shot 02-before-light
check_layout
